post. Free demo out now — Stages 1–3, and your save carries over to the full game. Controls: keyboard (Arrow keys / WASD to move, Space to dash). Full release: November 5, 2026 — a wishlist helps a solo developer more than anything.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:14:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031527","verified_at":"2026-10-22T12:24:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5018790-1846018067935573","game_id":"steam-5018790","kind":"announcement","title":"Free demo out now — join us at Steam Next Fest (Oct 19–26)!","summary":"Hi everyone, thank you for wishlisting Lazy Drawer: Line Survivors! The free demo is available now, and we're taking part in Steam Next Fest (Oct 19 – Oct 26). What is Lazy Drawer? No guns, no swords, no aiming. The path you walk becomes a line — enemies touching it get shredded, and the moment you close a loop, everything inside blows up at once. The more you trap, the bigger the boom. What's in the demo Stages 1–3, each with its own enemy waves, mid-boss and boss Upgrades, awakenings and hidde","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T07:23:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935573","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:38:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5018790-1846018067935567","game_id":"steam-5018790","kind":"announcement","title":"Streaming & Video Guidelines — monetization OK","summary":"You are free to stream and make videos of Lazy Drawer: Line Survivors. Streaming, let's plays and videos: OK — on any platform (YouTube, Twitch, TikTok, Niconico, etc.) Monetization: OK — ads, memberships, Super Chats, sponsorships All content: OK — demo and full game, every stage and boss; spoilers are fine Clips, shorts, thumbnails and edited videos: OK No permission or contact needed Credit is not required, but a link to the Steam page is always appreciated Please don't Redistribute the game ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T07:21:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935567","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:38:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5018790":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5018790":"2026-10-26T07:15:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5018790":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:10Z"},"5247650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:10Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5018790","app_id":5018790,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:17Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"003a47f4e3f7d9a16f2feff3cf14bbd0b80b88dfdd2e704609749e8d5ab1da9c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"총도 검도 없다. 무기는 당신이 걸어온 길 하나. 발걸음이 그은 선에 닿은 적은 갈리고, 선이 닫히는 순간 안에 갇힌 무리가 한꺼번에 터진다. 15분을 버티고, 보스를 잡고, 부적 덱을 키워 다시 출근하자. 걷는 것이 곧 공격인 드로잉 서바이버.","publishers":[{"name":"BottleTasteStudio"}],"developers":[{"name":"BottleTasteStudio"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796025600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Lazy Drawer: Line Surviv